Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A map of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.09,0:01:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's shaped like a lady. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.29,0:01:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An audience with the king, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna screw this up for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't have to\Nworry about any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we consider you to be\Na treasure created by our goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in that sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're actually the only one here\Nwho is considered equal to royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goddess of love and beauty\Ncreated our kingdom's royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first king received her blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now her crest only appears upon the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bodies of those who\Ninherit that same blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It proves that they are of the\Ngoddess's family, so to speak. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why it could\Nbe considered perjury.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it occurred to you that\NTachibana's crest might be fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem surprisingly prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You arrived too quickly\Nafter we caused the uproar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there's no delay in getting\Nan audience with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shen, how long have you\Nhad your sneaky eyes on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, have I been found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with you, dude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begging your pardon, Supervisor, but\Nhaven't you introduced yourself yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I've been entrusted with the\Nintelligence operations of the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Mouria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be more than\Nhappy to attend to your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,needs during your stay\Nin our lovely little...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and to think that all this time\Nyou've actually been the heroes, Jinguji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:03:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope that you'll continue\Nto favor me with your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can prove useful, I swear,\Nparticularly in the bedroom at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honored heroes, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king awaits.
