Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We welcome you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most honored heroes summoned\Nhere to us by our divine goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I see is an old guy\Nyou'd find at any sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The characters in Isekais always\Nmake this stuff look so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you get through an audience\Nwith royalty without popping a vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are pleased to have the\Nopportunity to meet you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:04:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He intends for me to charm the king to\Ngive us an edge in the discussion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my smile, the\Ncutest in all of history!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya, your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, was the double P sign too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our goddess's creations are indeed sublime\Nand lovely, just as one would expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it didn't even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goddess's creations?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that from the prophecy too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really possible that the heroes are\Nunaware of the contents of the prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case,\Nbring out the liar, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop the war with the war
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is cheerful, cheerful by chance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By our Goddess's hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a beautiful young woman was created\Nand summoned here as our true hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find the ones bearing the Holy Crest\Nso that we may be led to safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is what her words\Nmust mean. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to turn it\Ninto something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heroes who have been summoned here\Nby the Goddess of Love and Beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must do whatever it takes\Nto defeat the Demon Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demonstrate our Goddess's might\Nby being the first to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.09,0:06:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't hesitate to lend you\Nour support! Really? Support?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind, specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely we could give them our national\Nbudget for the year, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.39,0:06:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the national budget be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The military budget, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give them the taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we know my\Ncharm definitely worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it looks like my cuteness\Ndoes prove pretty useful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think it's about time you\Nfinally acknowledged it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't deny that it's a\Nhandy face to have around,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it just doesn't do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after all I've done to help,\Nyou're still anti-my cuteness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, ever since I became like this,\Nyou've been a lot colder towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, remember when you\Nwere fighting with Shen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:07:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me right now, do you like Shen's\Nbody more than mine, yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to tell you, we've\Njust decided to hold a banquet tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least they wear normal\Nclothes at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maids really went for it, and\NI think it was worth it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You changed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking snazzy, sir.
