Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you're banned. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just ridiculous. I wanna go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be done though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any alcohol?
