Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you do if it turned\Nout like that other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a stick-in-the-mud, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The drinks are pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you've already had some?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it'd be tough to be you, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I must say, the liquor in\Nthis kingdom is truly delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna drink good liquor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the heck is with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lately, you've been far too\Ncareless, and that's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop assuming that you'll\Nbe fine if it's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think's gonna happen if I stop\Nbeing able to fight off your charm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no need for you\Nto get as worked up as all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you even imagine the\Nstate I was in earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a teaching moment,\Nbecause it's hell on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your conduct has been intolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you disheartened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, do I look disheartened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were all ragey in her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone would react like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where does he get off\Nscolding me when he's the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one who's got to come to\Nterms with the way I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what that look on his face meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it's been a while\Nsince I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji was seriously cautioning\Nme in his own way, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta fight to say who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This curse is making me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguji's not what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a 32-year-old man, and my ideal\Nis a young, beautiful, blonde woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of innocent, if\Npossible, but still sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very important,\Nand kind of melancholy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like that.
