Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck possessed\Nme to run and hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's pretty obvious\NI was about to jump, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh, hence the freakout!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to convince me not to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, you know, like you do,\Nsuicide is not good for your health!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, it's pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in this world is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what about, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to\Ndo in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard things like don't\Ngive up have the opposite effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I try to distract her or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, could I bother you\Nfor a little bit of advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't born here in\Nthis country, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone who looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're much more\Nbeautiful than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I hitting on her? Right.\NI'm safe. I'm a girl. It's fine.
