Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words of praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the person I'm traveling with,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've actually been together\Never since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can kinda do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I'm afraid I'm\Nbecoming a burden to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I tried to see if there was anything\NI could do to make it easier on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't come up\Nwith a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I really thought that\Nat a banquet of all things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:12:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be able to use my\Nlooks to help out somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I not only failed at that\NI got him mad at me again!
