Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting I understand that completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were trying to make\Nthat person think you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were cute but you failed\Nand now you're depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it. The gentleman\Nyou like can't seem to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see you such a common\Nproblem really that's not it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I've\Nnever not been admired,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I have a feeling I'm not the best\Nperson to offer you advice on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listening is not in her skill set.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only looking for\Nsome general advice or
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ideas of how not to cause\Nmy partner more work, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after all I've done to help,\Nyou're still anti my cuteness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want him to praise me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I can't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally love basking in\Nthat feeling of superiority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if all I wanted was\Nto feel cute and superior
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could just charm some\Nother man. It's just being
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flattered by other guys\Ndoesn't really do anything for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me why wow you're amazing\NI'm proud of you I mean have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ever once been praised\Nby him in all the years
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've known each other oh\Ngod I haven't like never do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I obsessively need him to\Nbe impressed with me So
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm roughly as mature as\Nyour standard eight-year-old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear that you must love\Nthat person very much indeed.
