Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.69,0:13:27.15,Text2,text,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(237,0)\fnAnime Inept\b0\bord0\fs85\c&HEFD8F8&\pos(1072,143.78)\4a&HFF&}Hee hee hee
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a truly hopeless case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone told you\Nyou're deeply unhelpful?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it did prove to\Nbe a nice distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like you a lot, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feeling this way about\NJinguji is the curse's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that for a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering just spending\Ntime with that beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,girl has made me feel like\NI'm on top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those other feelings are fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathing down my neck as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want more than anything\Nto see your smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.19,0:14:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just really hope you two will\Nmake up as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tachibana?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I summon you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hero is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the first princess of this\Nkingdom and I'm called Yggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night I didn't know who you were\Nand I was terribly impolite. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she's the reason\NTachibana's acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honored hero, I've come before\Nyou today with a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please take me with you on your\Ngreat journey to defeat the Demon Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hero, allow me to accompany you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our journey here is difficult,\Ndirty, and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it the three Ds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far from the kind of carefree\Nfantasy a child might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Condescension.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please kindly stay\Nout of this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to be addressing our\Nhonored hero right at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what you should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try going out\Nand having a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're obviously serious and intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't know much\Nabout the world, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, you have every appearance\Nof a stiff and pointless kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always just been the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prideful men are all like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're angry, but Arson\Nis not the answer, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, let's think about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:16:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is like when a supervisor\Nonce asked for a party-level
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trick performance and Jinguuji\Nmade the fire alarm go off,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which then resulted in party\Ntricks being declared forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the spot all because of\Nhis ultra-special technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, was that entertaining\Nenough for you, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you meant it as revenge\Nfor my treating you like a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I fear you've picked\Nthe wrong opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there\Nis nothing I cannot do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to travel\Nwith us in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, isn't it, Jinguji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's hesitating because she's got\Na reason not to tell us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pushing it would be childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, dude, but logic and\Nreasoning is not gonna work on a kid like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too much of a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought of accidentally\Npushing her over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the edge literally scares\Nthe crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta try some other tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something gentler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course you can't go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly you must go on a journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about your official duties then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides all that, siding against\Nthe demon lord will be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When dealing with stubborn kids, sometimes\Nit's best to turn to their parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't even get dressed\Nby yourself and you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get to sleep without\Nholding your favorite doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting a public execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive as usual, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving this to her\Nfather means her heart is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guaranteed to be smoothly\Nand efficiently crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right in thinking you're\Nsuited to human resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd punch me\Nfor foolishly believing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wanted to bring a\Nwoman on our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, honored hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As things stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is just as you say, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the least, she should be able to\Ngo to the bathroom alone at night.
