Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you making it worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Tachibana. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what's up here.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.14,0:17:59.13,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.8\fax.0\fnb Blue Vanilla\i0\c&H93B3CA&\3c&H80A6BD&\bord0\fs84\t(0,268,\c&H0F1324&\3c&H0F1324&)\b1\pos(45.12,103.89)}Break her \Ninto a\Nmillion pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break her until there's\Nnothing left, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know what's up at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biggie, you understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.89,0:18:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't ask for things like\Na willful child might anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Four Eyes, are you\Nhaving fun looking so smug?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you don't\Nunderstand a single thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous, everyone's stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moji, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about demon\Nlords or heroes anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Moji never will ever get the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so she knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be inside the castle, but\Nyou can't go off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the worst at\Ndealing with teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the what?
