Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously, I'm venting my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:18:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do at least\Nthis much or else, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great you have a healthy\Nway to blow off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But considering that, why\Ndon't we try to calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Hero, the truth is, I don't even\Nhave the freedom to leave if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to understand, my\Nmother died when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So my father became\Noverly protective of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any friends close\Nto my age who share my station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No memories of running\Nacross grassy fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never found anything\NI really wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all feels so pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder I can't leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything that I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have something in your\Nhead that you've been dreaming of?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I want to make it a reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.99,0:19:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are going to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise, my people! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A king has caught up in outward beauty\Nand forgets true worth's adventure rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up, princess? What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The leaders of the rebellion\Nare Princess Yggie and the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is calling for a new ruler
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the abolishment of\Nhereditary succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this nightmare happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll deploy the military and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do that and Iggy\Ngets hurt, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if we use the Intelligence Department\Nto contain the Princess in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intelligence Department!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the right time for a\Ndeadweight department to shine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to say good luck,\Nand we're all counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.61,0:20:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the highlight was our Supervisor,\Nwho couldn't seem to refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is now orchestrating a last-ditch\Nattack on the Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.53,0:20:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when melancholy or sublime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying with a rebel\Narmy is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to drag you back here\Neven if it's against your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Tachibana actually\Nwanted to travel with that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just the type Tachibana\Nusually likes, plus she's a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we went to have the\Nking give her a scolding,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was it actually to have the\Nking give his permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you don't\Nunderstand a single thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't understand a single thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, I don't get it, what\Nthe heck am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.31,0:21:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall give my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that Mouria has\Nfailed and been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So futile after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I had a feeling it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:21:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call in that person!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.95,0:22:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What person?
